-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Algorithmic reference: ORB-SLAM3
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The design of the tracking pipeline in this repository (stereo initialisation,
tracking against a local map, the keyframe insertion policy, and the staged
visual-inertial initialisation with its inertial bundle-adjustment schedule)
follows the algorithms described in:

  C. Campos, R. Elvira, J. J. Gomez Rodriguez, J. M. M. Montiel and
  J. D. Tardos, "ORB-SLAM3: An Accurate Open-Source Library for Visual,
  Visual-Inertial, and Multimap SLAM", IEEE Transactions on Robotics,
  vol. 37, no. 6, pp. 1874-1890, 2021.

ORB-SLAM3 is a separate project distributed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3. The ORB-SLAM3 paper and its public source code were
consulted as a design reference. No ORB-SLAM3 source code is included in this
repository.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Estimation back end: kornia-slam
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The feature extraction, stereo matching, map, pose estimation and bundle
adjustment used by this crate are provided by kornia-slam
(https://github.com/kornia/kornia-slam) and kornia-rs
(https://github.com/kornia/kornia-rs), both licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. They are consumed as dependencies and are not vendored here.
